{'symbol': 'LMT', 'date': '2023-01-25 17:00:00', 'title': 'SAP EXPANDS 25-YEAR PARTNERSHIP WITH LOCKHEED MARTIN', 'text': "LOCKHEED MARTIN CHOOSES RISE WITH SAP AS THE SECURE SOLUTION TO FUEL 1LMX TRANSFORMATION BETHESDA, MD. , JAN. 25, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LOCKHEED MARTIN CORPORATION\xa0(NYSE: LMT)\xa0AND SAP SE\xa0(NYSE: SAP) ANNOUNCED TODAY AN EXPANSION OF THEIR STRATEGIC RELATIONSHIP TO TRANSFORM THE MISSION-CRITICAL BUSINESS SYSTEMS THAT POWER LOCKHEED MARTIN'S ONELM TRANSFORMATION PROGRAM (1LMX)."}